      "description": "This is the default type for all of the DC elements. It permits text content only with optional xml:lang attribute. Text is allowed because mixed=\"true\", but sub-elements are disallowed because minOccurs=\"0\" and maxOccurs=\"0\" are on the xs:any tag. This complexType allows for restriction or extension permitting child elements.",
